  "description": {
    "text": "Meowth's Little Tricks (喵喵小妙招) is a theme pack given out at the open-and-play events that launched Primordial Arts, held at gyms across China from 17 to 26 November 2023. Players signed up through the official mini program, bought a Primordial Arts V Starter Deck and six 25-card packs of one Primordial Arts booster at the gym, and received two theme packs. They opened everything there, built a 60-card deck from those 215 cards alone, and played three Swiss rounds in groups of eight. Pokémon made 190,000 theme packs, each holding two random cards.\n\nIts ten cards are Meowth V and Meowth VMAX with eight Trainers: Pal Pad, Moomoo Cheese, Big Parasol, Telescopic Sight, Team Yell Grunt, Galar Mine, Level Ball and Cook.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: The Primordial Arts launch open-and-play events and the Meowth's Little Tricks theme pack (10 November 2023)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/event/16053.html"
      }
    ]
  },
  "tell": {
    "text": "A \"CS2.1C\" mark at the bottom left, and a number out of 010",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon China: The Primordial Arts launch open-and-play events and the Meowth's Little Tricks theme pack (10 November 2023)",
        "url": "https://www.pokemon.cn/tcg/event/16053.html"
      }
    ]
  },
